body: "Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1486\n\nThe existing pm-nbht delivered summary mode, and pm-du93sr delivered compact check-only guidance; their completed closures are preserved. This new report concerns the default/brief surfaces and extension registry expansion, including a history_drift brief projection larger than default. Reproduce before choosing an additive verbose-detail flag or changing default projection. Keep SDK semantics authoritative and CLI/MCP output behavior aligned."
